- { "id": "C0011849", "name": "diabetes mellitus", "pos": [54, 71] }
- { "id": "C0085207", "name": "gestational diabetes mellitus", "pos": [124, 153] }

Title of the Paper: Factors possibly influencing the development of diabetic retinopathy.

Abstract of the Paper: Factors possibly influencing the development of diabetic retinopathy were studied in 112 randomly selected type 1 diabetics having no or minimal retinopathy (group A) and in 82 type 1 diabetics with known severe diabetic retinopathy. The study aimed to investigate the potential risk factors that contribute to the progression of diabetic retinopathy in type 1 diabetic patients.

