Title of the Paper: Epidemiological study of prevalence of chlorpropamide alcohol flushing in insulin dependent diabetics, non-insulin dependent diabetics, and non-diabetics.

Abstract of the Paper: This study investigates the prevalence of chlorpropamide alcohol flushing in different groups, including insulin-dependent diabetics, non-insulin-dependent diabetics, and non-diabetics. The objective is to understand how different diabetic conditions respond to chlorpropamide and the role of insulin in managing these conditions.

